{"seq":2,"slug":"pipeline-blending-refueling-station","title":"氢气管道输送、掺氢管网与加氢站加注系统工程设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/green-hydrogen-electrolysis-fuel-cell-systems/hydrogen-storage-transport-infrastructure/pipeline-blending-refueling-station","wordCount":3090,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"氢气管道输送-掺氢管网与加氢站加注系统工程设计\">氢气管道输送、掺氢管网与加氢站加注系统工程设计</h1><p>管道和加氢站是绿氢从电解槽走到终端的两条&quot;最后一公里&quot;通道，但它们的物理难度完全不同：管道要解决的是氢对钢的<strong>氢脆</strong>和在役天然气管网的<strong>兼容掺混上限</strong>，加氢站要解决的是 35 MPa/70 MPa 高压下的<strong>快速加注温升控制</strong>。两者共同的工程主轴是同一个——把氢的分子特性（最小分子、低体积能量密度、宽爆炸极限）翻译成材料、压力等级和计量口径的具体设计参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>氢气管道按用途分三类：<strong>长输纯氢管道</strong>（如美国墨西哥湾沿岸约 2600 km 的既有氢气管网、欧洲 Air Liquide 与 Linde 运营的工业氢气管网）、<strong>在役天然气管网掺氢</strong>（blending）、以及<strong>加氢站内的站内高压管路</strong>（多为 316L 不锈钢或 316L 内衬）。三者的设计压力、泄漏管理和材料要求逐级加严。</p>\n<p>输氢的物理约束来自氢的体积能量密度。在标准状态下氢的低热值约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mtext> MJ/kg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LHV = 120\\ \\text{MJ/kg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MJ/kg</span></span></span></span></span></span>，而密度仅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.0899</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>kg/m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.0899\\ \\text{kg/m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0899</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kg/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，因此常压体积能量密度只有天然气（约 36 MJ/m³）的三分之一。同等能量下掺氢必然增大体积流量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>H</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>L</mi><mi>H</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>10.8</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>MJ/m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_H = \\frac{P_{gas}}{LHV_H \\cdot \\rho_H}, \\qquad LHV_H \\rho_H \\approx 10.8\\ \\text{MJ/m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10.8</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MJ/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这就是为什么 20 vol% 掺氢后，同一条管道输送的<strong>能量</strong>只增加约 6–7%，而管输气体体积流量上升约 20%——压缩机功耗和管容占用随之抬升。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[绿氢源 电解槽] --&gt; B{输送路径}&#10;    B --&gt;|高压气态&lt;br/&gt;1-3 MPa| C[长输纯氢管道&lt;br/&gt;API 5L X42/X52]&#10;    B --&gt;|掺入在役管网&lt;br/&gt;2-8 vol%| D[天然气掺氢&lt;br/&gt;需终端适配]&#10;    B --&gt;|液氢/高压拖车| E[加氢站站内]&#10;    C --&gt; F[工业用户 炼化/合成氨]&#10;    D --&gt; G[燃气轮机/锅炉&lt;br/&gt;Wobbe 指数约束]&#10;    E --&gt; H{加注压力等级}&#10;    H --&gt;|35 MPa| I[大巴/物流车 T40]&#10;    H --&gt;|70 MPa| J[乘用车 H70]&#10;    H --&gt;|液氢 350-700 bar| K[重卡长续航]\">graph TD\n    A[绿氢源 电解槽] --&gt; B{输送路径}\n    B --&gt;|高压气态&lt;br/&gt;1-3 MPa| C[长输纯氢管道&lt;br/&gt;API 5L X42/X52]\n    B --&gt;|掺入在役管网&lt;br/&gt;2-8 vol%| D[天然气掺氢&lt;br/&gt;需终端适配]\n    B --&gt;|液氢/高压拖车| E[加氢站站内]\n    C --&gt; F[工业用户 炼化/合成氨]\n    D --&gt; G[燃气轮机/锅炉&lt;br/&gt;Wobbe 指数约束]\n    E --&gt; H{加注压力等级}\n    H --&gt;|35 MPa| I[大巴/物流车 T40]\n    H --&gt;|70 MPa| J[乘用车 H70]\n    H --&gt;|液氢 350-700 bar| K[重卡长续航]</pre><p>管道设计的第一性问题是<strong>氢脆</strong>（hydrogen embrittlement）。氢原子渗入钢晶格后在应力集中区聚集，降低材料的断裂韧性，表现为裂纹扩展速率上升、疲劳寿命下降。工程上按材料等级、压力与氢分压选材，常用的判据是 ASME B31.12《Hydrogen Piping and Pipelines》，它给出了材料性能系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与设计系数。同一根钢管在氢环境下许用应力低于天然气环境，因此&quot;直接换气不换管&quot;往往不可行。</p>\n<p>下表对比纯氢管道、掺氢管网与站内高压系统的关键设计参数（数据区间综合自 ASME B31.12、EIGA 与欧盟委员会 2022 年天然气掺氢技术报告等公开文件）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>长输纯氢管道</th>\n<th>在役管网掺氢</th>\n<th>加氢站站内高压</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>典型压力</td>\n<td>1–10 MPa</td>\n<td>与原管网同（0.3–8 MPa）</td>\n<td>35 MPa / 70 MPa</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>掺氢比例</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>2–20 vol%（分国别）</td>\n<td>100%（纯氢）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主流材料</td>\n<td>API 5L X42/X52、316L</td>\n<td>原管线钢（X52/X70）</td>\n<td>316L、内衬 PTFE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键失效模式</td>\n<td>氢脆、疲劳裂纹</td>\n<td>Wobbe 指数偏移、末端燃烧适配</td>\n<td>快速加注温升、密封泄漏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要标准</td>\n<td>ASME B31.12、ASME PCC-2</td>\n<td>各国注入规范（见下文）</td>\n<td>SAE J2601、SAE J2799、ISO 17268</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本敏感点</td>\n<td>管材等级、壁厚裕量</td>\n<td>掺混点计量、终端改造</td>\n<td>压缩机、储氢瓶组、预冷机组</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"长输纯氢管道的材料与强度设计\">长输纯氢管道的材料与强度设计</h2><p>纯氢管道选材要同时满足<strong>强度</strong>与<strong>抗氢脆</strong>。ASME B31.12 把管材按验证程度分级，并要求在设计压力下对许用应力乘以材料性能系数。常见做法是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>优先选低强度、高韧性的钢种（X42、X52），因为强度越高，氢脆敏感度通常越大；X70 及以上需更严格的验证。</li>\n<li>壁厚按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>S</mi><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = \\frac{P D}{2 S F H_f}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4204em;vertical-align:-0.5481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 计算，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 为设计压力、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为外径、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 为材料许用应力、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 为设计系数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为氢环境材料性能系数（&lt;1）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 直接压低了承载能力，这是纯氢管道壁厚普遍大于同压天然气管道的根本原因。</li>\n<li>焊接接头是薄弱环节：热影响区硬度须受控（常要求 ≤ 22 HRC），焊后无损检测与氢环境断裂韧性试验（如 ASTM E1681）用于验证。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对老管线<strong>改输</strong>纯氢（repurposing），行业共识是必须先做完整性评估：管材钢级、服役历史、内壁腐蚀、焊缝缺陷、阀门与法兰密封等级都要复核。欧洲的 Northern Lights、Hynet 等改输项目普遍采用&quot;降额使用&quot;策略，即把设计压力降到原值的 60–80% 来补偿氢脆带来的韧性损失。</p>\n<p>长输管道相比高压拖车有量级成本优势：当输送量超过约 10 吨/日、距离超过 100 km 时，管道单位输氢成本通常低于气态拖车。这一判断直接进入项目的输送方式比选，与 <a href=\"../hydrogen-system-policy-model/lcoh-cost-modeling-sensitivity\">LCOH 成本建模与敏感性分析</a> 中的物流成本项挂钩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在役天然气管网掺氢-浓度上限与终端约束\">在役天然气管网掺氢：浓度上限与终端约束</h2><p>把氢掺入既有天然气管网的最大吸引力是<strong>资产复用</strong>——无需新建管道即可消纳就近绿氢。但掺氢比例不是随意设定的，它受三条独立约束封顶：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>材料与密封完整性</strong>：掺氢使聚乙烯（PE）管、球磨铸铁管和老旧钢管面临渗透与氢脆风险，阀门与压缩机的泄漏率上升。</li>\n<li><strong>终端燃烧特性</strong>：氢的 Wobbe 指数低于甲烷，掺氢导致单位体积热值下降（20 vol% 掺氢约降 7%），燃气轮机、锅炉和家用灶具需重新标定；工业燃气轮机厂商通常只对 5–30 vol% 掺氢给出售后许可。</li>\n<li><strong>计量与贸易</strong>：体积计量在掺氢后不再等价于能量计量，需要转为能量计量（kWh）或引入热值在线分析仪。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>正因为约束来自终端，各国的掺氢上限差异极大：法国 GRTgaz 的试点允许掺氢约 6 vol%，德国部分管网试点到 8–10 vol%，荷兰与英国的多项示范在 2–20 vol% 区间做验证，部分封闭工业管网甚至测试更高比例。工程上一个稳妥的做法是<strong>先按 2 vol% 全网掺混、再在局部支线提高比例</strong>，因为 2 vol% 通常无需改造终端设备即可兼容，是&quot;零改造门槛&quot;。</p>\n<p>掺氢系统还必须在掺混点做精确配比与在线监测。典型架构是：电解槽出氢经压缩机升压到管网压力，通过质量流量计与天然气管道的超声波流量计联动调节掺混比例，下游布点用气相色谱或激光光谱分析氢浓度与热值。混气均匀性差会导致下游局部浓度超标，因此注入点需保证足够的下游混合长度（工程经验常取 50–100 倍管径）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"加氢站加注系统工程设计\">加氢站加注系统工程设计</h2><p>加氢站的设计核心是<strong>在受控温升内把氢快速压入车载储氢瓶</strong>。以 70 MPa 的 H70 加注为例，氢气从站内储氢压缩到 87.5 MPa 左右，经加注机节流进入车瓶时绝热膨胀，瓶内温度可迅速升至 85 ℃ 以上，超过 Type IV 瓶（塑料内胆碳纤维全缠绕）的 85 ℃ 上限。因此需要<strong>预冷</strong>：SAE J2601 规定在 -40 ℃ 至 -33 ℃ 区间对加注气体预冷，配合通信协议按瓶内状态动态调节加注速率。</p>\n<p>加注控制的核心是<strong>目标压力补偿</strong>。车载瓶的额定工作压力 70 MPa 是在 15 ℃ 标定的，而充装到不同环境温度时须按温压关系补偿：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mn>288.15</mn><mtext> K</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{target} = P_{nom} \\cdot \\frac{T_{gas}}{288.15\\ \\text{K}} \\cdot Z(T,P)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">288.15</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">K</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span> 为氢的压缩因子（在 70 MPa、-40–85 ℃ 区间约 1.0–1.4），高温下 Z 明显偏离 1，所以加注协议（SAE J2601 的 Table-based 与 MC Formula 两种方法）必须用真实氢状态方程而非理想气体近似。MC Formula（Mass-average Cost formula）通过周期测量瓶内温压反推密度，能在 3 分钟内完成 70 MPa 加注且不超温。</p>\n<p>加氢站的典型设备链如下（以 70 MPa 站为例）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>氢气源</strong>：管束车（20 MPa 或 30 MPa 长管拖车）或站内电解制氢，或液氢储罐（重卡场景）。</li>\n<li><strong>压缩机</strong>：隔膜式（适合高压、无油、纯度高）或液驱活塞式（大流量、可频繁启停）。出口压力需高于 87.5 MPa 才能给 70 MPa 加注。</li>\n<li><strong>储氢系统</strong>：通常分低压/中压/高压三级瓶组（如 45/65/87.5 MPa）分级加注，减少压缩机启停次数、提升加注速率。</li>\n<li><strong>预冷机组</strong>：制冷量须匹配峰值加注速率，-40 ℃ 出口设计。</li>\n<li><strong>加注机与枪口</strong>：符合 SAE J2799 的红外数据通信，实现车-站协议握手（否则只能降级为受限加注）；枪口机械接口符合 ISO 17268。</li>\n<li><strong>安全系统</strong>：氢泄漏探测（催化燃烧或电化学传感器）、紧急切断阀、防爆电气、泄爆/通风设计。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>35 MPa 站（T40）用于大巴与物流车，设计简化、成本低，但单车储氢量少、续航短；70 MPa 站（H70）用于乘用车，能量密度高但对预冷和压缩机要求更严。液氢站（配合 350–700 bar 加注）适合重卡长续航，蒸发损失（boil-off）与站内蒸发气管理是额外难点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计量-泄漏与安全设计要点\">计量、泄漏与安全设计要点</h2><p>氢的分子极小，泄漏倾向远高于天然气，因此<strong>泄漏即安全</strong>是贯穿设计的原则。关键措施包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有承压连接优先焊接或金属面密封，螺纹连接仅用于低压仪表；法兰用高等级垫片并做氦检漏。</li>\n<li>站内与管廊设置<strong>多点氢浓度探测</strong>，报警阈值通常取爆炸下限（LEL，氢约 4 vol%）的 10% 与 25% 两级。</li>\n<li>通风设计按最不利泄漏场景计算换气次数；受限空间（如地沟、阀井）须强制通风且禁止氢气聚集。</li>\n<li>加注区设防撞柱、接地防静电、紧急切断（ESD）按钮，加注枪带断裂脱离保护。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>计量上，氢的气态贸易结算正从体积（Nm³）向质量（kg）与能量（kWh）迁移。加氢站普遍采用科里奥利质量流量计，精度等级直接影响结算；管输掺氢则需在线热值分析配合能量计量。掺氢的贸易复杂性在于：上游按体积注入、下游按能量使用，中间需要明确热值基准与分配规则，这属于商务与监管接口，需与管网运营方在合同中约定。</p>\n<p>安全标准体系可归纳为：管道侧以 ASME B31.12 为核心，站内高压管路参照 ASME B31.3 与 ISO 19880 系列（ISO 19880-1 为加氢站通用要求，覆盖设备、安全与验收），加注接口由 SAE J2601/J2799 与 ISO 17268 覆盖。设备选型与<a href=\"../electrolyzer-technology-engineering/electrolysis-route-selection\">电解制氢技术路线</a>存在耦合：PEM 电解可高压直出、纯度高，减少站内压缩级数；碱性电解需额外干燥与压缩，对站内设备配置有影响。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>输氢三条路径各有明确适用区间</strong>：长输纯氢管道适合大流量长距离，在役管网掺氢适合就近消纳但受终端约束封顶，车运/站内高压适合分散小量需求。</li>\n<li><strong>氢脆决定纯氢管道选材与壁厚</strong>，ASME B31.12 的材料性能系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是设计计算的关键修正项，改输需先做完整性评估并降额。</li>\n<li><strong>掺氢比例由终端而非管道决定</strong>，2 vol% 是常见的&quot;零改造门槛&quot;，燃气轮机与锅炉的适应性是硬约束，计量须转向能量口径。</li>\n<li><strong>加氢站的核心矛盾是快与不超温</strong>，SAE J2601 的预冷加注与温压补偿公式是解决路径，70 MPa 站需 87.5 MPa 压缩与 -40 ℃ 预冷。</li>\n<li><strong>泄漏管理是氢安全的全部</strong>，从焊接连接、多点探测到通风与 ESD，设计必须围绕最小分子特性展开。</li>\n<li>管道与站内的成本、压力等级最终都回落到项目的经济性模型，与 LCOH 和输送量比选一并决策。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"氢气管道输送、掺氢管网与加氢站加注系统工程设计","id":"氢气管道输送-掺氢管网与加氢站加注系统工程设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"长输纯氢管道的材料与强度设计","id":"长输纯氢管道的材料与强度设计"},{"level":2,"text":"在役天然气管网掺氢：浓度上限与终端约束","id":"在役天然气管网掺氢-浓度上限与终端约束"},{"level":2,"text":"加氢站加注系统工程设计","id":"加氢站加注系统工程设计"},{"level":2,"text":"计量、泄漏与安全设计要点","id":"计量-泄漏与安全设计要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高压气态/液氢/氨/有机液态储氢载体技术经济对比建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/green-hydrogen-electrolysis-fuel-cell-systems/hydrogen-storage-transport-infrastructure/storage-carrier-tech-economics"},"next":{"title":"储运安全、泄漏监控与氢能基础设施许可合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/green-hydrogen-electrolysis-fuel-cell-systems/hydrogen-storage-transport-infrastructure/storage-safety-permitting-compliance"}}